{
  "_comment": "UNVERIFIED on this host. Intended seccomp allowlist for running untrusted model repository code under a Linux kernel-backed runtime (libseccomp / OCI runtime spec 'linux.seccomp'). Default action denies everything not explicitly allowed. This file is a committed profile only; it is NOT enforced by the portable restricted_subprocess backend.",
